<title>FRANCE: Lagardere, Thomson to requote Thursday - SBF.</title>
<headline>Lagardere, Thomson to requote Thursday - SBF.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French stockmarkets association SBF said trading in shares in Lagardere Group, Thomson SA and Thomson-CSF would resume on Thursday.</p>
<p>Trading in the shares was suspended after the French government announced a preference on Wednesday for Lagardere's bid for Thomson.</p>
<p>The SBF said in a statement that trade in the shares would resume on October 17 at the customary hour.</p>
</text>
